# F16 step 3: --select through local links into a share and a part missing there (none/..): the
# share listed by its lister (sub/ and x.txt), the name to select taken as given (ghost.txt isn't
# there: the cursor on the first).
settle
wait-for 3000 faron=1 farloading=0 n=2 sel=sub statusbad=0
quit
